 "_": "Abundance reel («Ирээдүйд бүх зүйл үнэгүй болно»). Edit this file, then run npm run build:abundance-reel (writes cues.json + stems). 'from' is seconds in the original YouTube video. A beat lasts lead + pre + voice + post (or 'hold'); its cuts share that time in proportion to 'len'. A cut with \"mute\": true plays no source sound (the intro film has its own music). 'shots' lists the camera cuts inside each downloaded clip (seconds into the clip) and how to frame them: elon = 4:5 crop centred on x, med = 1.3x crop on Elon standing, wide = 1.6x crop centred on x, slide = the abundance slide zoomed past its English text, sat = the Saturn slide zoomed past its title, anim = 4:5 centre crop of the intro film.",
